%% API flow — POST /api/receiving-documents/{id}/receipts (main receiving workflow)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Operator
    participant FE as React UI
    participant API as Express (route + service)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: Enter quantities, click "Record receipt"
    FE->>FE: Client-side checks (1 ≤ qty ≤ remaining), generate Idempotency-Key (UUID), disable button
    FE->>API: POST /receiving-documents/12/receipts<br/>Authorization: Bearer …, Idempotency-Key: …<br/>{lines:[{itemId,quantity}]}
    API->>API: Verify JWT → role ∈ {OPERATOR, SUPERVISOR}
    API->>API: zod: lines 1..100, integers 1..1,000,000, no duplicate itemId
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: SELECT … FROM receiving_documents WHERE id=12 FOR UPDATE
    alt document not found
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>FE: 404 NOT_FOUND
    end
    opt Idempotency-Key present
        API->>DB: SELECT receipt WHERE idempotency_key = …
        alt key exists, same document and same lines
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK (nothing changed)
            API-->>FE: 200 original receipt (replay)
        else key exists, other document or other lines
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK
            API-->>FE: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
        end
    end
    alt status ∉ {OPEN, PARTIALLY_RECEIVED}
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>FE: 409 INVALID_STATE
    end
    API->>DB: SELECT … FROM receiving_items WHERE document_id=12 ORDER BY product_id FOR UPDATE
    loop each line
        API->>API: item belongs to document? (else 422 ITEM_NOT_IN_DOCUMENT)
        API->>API: quantity ≤ expected − received? (else 422 OVER_RECEIPT)
    end
    note over API,DB: Any failure above → ROLLBACK, nothing is recorded (BR-08)
    API->>DB: INSERT receipts (document_id, received_by, idempotency_key)
    loop each line, ordered by product_id
        API->>DB: UPDATE receiving_items SET received_quantity += qty
        API->>DB: INSERT inventory … ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE on_hand += qty RETURNING on_hand
        API->>DB: INSERT inventory_transactions (qty, balance_after, receipt_id, item_id, user)
    end
    API->>DB: UPDATE receiving_documents SET status = FULLY_RECEIVED | PARTIALLY_RECEIVED
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 201 {receipt, document}
    FE-->>U: Show updated quantities and status
